 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 666723,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the output of the following code?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">sentence = \"This is a sentence\"\nindex = sentence.index(\" \")\nprint(sentence[:index])\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1329194,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"This\"</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">sentence.index(\" \")</code> returns the index of the first space character. The print statement prints the prefix of the sentence ending just before the first space character, so the output is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"This\"</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1329195,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"This \"</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The index variable is the index of the first occurrence of space, and is 4. What is the substring <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">sentence[:4]</code>?"
    },
    {
     "id": 1329196,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"sentence\"</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">sentence[:index]</code> prints the sentence variable's prefix up to the given index. <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"sentence\"</code> is not the prefix of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">\"This is a sentence\"</code>."
    }
   ],
